
  riscvsim › demo 2 · Waiting for memory                          cycle 5 of 9

     1 # A load reads memory in MEM, one stage later than the
     2 # ALU, so the add right after it must wait one cycle.
     3 .data
     4 value:  .word 41
     5
     6 .text
     7 addi x4, x0, 1     # x4 = 1                            WB
     8 lui  x2, 0x10000   # x2 = 0x10000000, where value is   MEM
  ›  9 lw   x1, 0(x2)     # x1 = 41, read from memory         EX
    10 add  x3, x1, x4    # needs x1 now: one stall           ID

  ┌─ IF ────────┐┌─ ID ────────┐┌─ EX ────────┐┌─ MEM ───────┐┌─ WB ────────┐
  │ ·           ││ add x3,x1…  ││ lw x1,0(x2) ││ lui x2…     ││ addi x4,x0… │
  └─────────────┘└─────────────┘└─────────────┘└─────────────┘└─────────────┘
    ✓ x4 = 1

  ! lw is reading memory. add must wait one cycle because it needs x1 from lw.

